nv":1,"bb":{"1Chr":1},"occ":["1Chr.2.53"]},"H4913":{"l":"מָשָׁל","tl":"ma.shal","g":"Mashal","d":"§ Mashal = \"entreaty\"; a town in the territory of Asher allotted to the Gershonite Levites; Another name of mish.al (מִשְׁאָל \"Mishal\" H4861)","n":1,"nv":1,"bb":{"1Chr":1},"occ":["1Chr.6.74"]},"H4936":{"l":"מִשְׁעָם","tl":"mish.am","g":"Misham","d":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.8.12; ; son of: Elpaal (H0508); ; brother of: Eber (H5677I), Shemed (H8106B), Beriah (H1283I), Shema (H8087I), Zebadiah (H2069H), Meshullam (H4918J), Hizki (H2395), Heber (H2268J), Ishmerai (H3461), Izliah (H3152) and Jobab (H3103K) ; § Misham = \"purification\"; a Benjamite, son of Elpaal and descendant of Shaharaim","n":1,"nv":1,"bb":{"1Chr":1},"occ":["1Chr.8.12"]},"H4921":{"l":"מְשִׁלֵּמִית","tl":"me.shil.le.mit","g":"Meshillemith","d":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at 1Ch.9.12; ; son of: Immer (H0564); ; father of: Meshullam (H4918M); also called Meshillemoth at Neh.11.13;; Also named: me.shil.le.mot (מְשִׁלֵּמוֹת \"Meshillemoth\" H4919H) ; § Meshillemith = \"recompense\"; a priest, son of Immer. See also 'Meshillemoth'","n":1,"nv":1,"bb":{"1Chr":1},"occ":["1Chr.9.12"]},"H4920":{"l":"מְשֶׁלֶמְיָהוּ","tl":"me.she.lem.yah","g":"Meshelemiah","d":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at 1Ch.9.21; ; father of: Zechariah (H2148A), Jediael (H3043J), Zebadiah (H2069J), Jathniel (H3496), Elam (H5867H), Jehohanan (H3076I) and Eliehoenai (H0454A); also called Shelemiah at 1Ch.26.14;; Also named: she.lem.yah (שֶׁלֶמְיָהוּ \"Shelemiah\" H8018O) ; § Meshelemiah = \"whom Jehovah repays\"; a Korhite Levite porter or gatekeeper of the house of God in the time of David","n":4,"nv":4,"bb":{"1Chr":4},"occ":["1Chr.9.21","1Chr.26.1","1Chr.26.2","1Chr.26.9"]},"H4993":{"l":"מַתִּתְיָ֫הוּ","tl":"mat.tit.yah","g":"Mattithiah","d":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at 1Ch.9.31; ; son of: Shallum (H7967M); § Mattithiah = \"gift of Jehovah\"; 1) a Levite who presided over the offerings; 2) a Levite appointed by David to minister in the musical service before the ark; 3) one of the family of Nebo who had a foreign wife in the time of Ezra; 4) one of the men who stood at the right hand of Ezra when he read the law to the people","n":8,"nv":8,"bb":{"1Chr":6,"Ezra":1,"Neh":1},"occ":["1Chr.9.31","1Chr.15.18","1Chr.15.21","1Chr.16.5","1Chr.25.3","1Chr.25.21","Ezra.10.43","Neh.8.4"]},"H4981":{"l":"מִתְנִי","tl":"mit.ni","g":"Mithnite","d":"Someone descended from Mithn(?), only mentioned at 1Ch.11.43 ; § Mithnite = \"athlete\"; 1) unknown derivation; 1a) used in description of Joshaphat, one of David's guards","n":1,"nv":1,"bb":{"1Chr":1},"occ":["1Chr.11.43"]},"H4925":{"l":"מִשְׁמַנָּה","tl":"mish.man.nah","g":"Mishmannah","d":"A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.12.10 ; § Mishmannah = \"fatness\"; a Gadite, one of David's mighty warriors, who joined him at Ziklag","n":1,"nv":1,"bb":{"1Chr":1},"occ":["1Chr.12.10"]},"H4919":{"l":"מְשִׁלֵּמוֹת","tl":"me.shil.le.mot","g":"Meshillemoth","d":"A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 2Ch.28.12; ; father of: Berechiah (H1296J); § Meshillemoth = \"recompense\"; 1) an Ephraimite, one of the chiefs of the tribe in the reign of king Pekah of Israel; 1a) also 'Meshillemith'; 2) a priest, son of Immer; 2a) also 'Meshillemith'","n":2,"nv":2,"bb":{"2Chr":1,"Neh":1},"occ":["2Chr.28.12","Neh.11.13"]},"H4990":{"l":"מִתְרְדָת","tl":"mit.re.dat","g":"Mithredath","d":"A man living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at Ezr.1.8; § Mithredath = \"given by Mithra\"; 1) treasurer of king Cyrus of Persia; 2) a Persian officer stationed at Samaria in the time of Artaxerxes","n":2,"nv":2,"bb":{"Ezra":2},"occ":["Ezra.1.8","Ezra.4.7"]},"H4907":{"l":"מִשְׁכַּן","tl":"mish.kan","g":"habitation"